Feature: Smoke Test for Knowledge Navigator

  As a user
  I want to verify that the core functionalities of Knowledge Navigator work correctly
  So that I can access, interact with, and log out of the system successfully

  @smoke-test
  Scenario: Successful login with valid credentials
    Given the user opens the login page
    When the user clicks the "Mit Keycloak anmelden" button
    And the user clicks the "Fortfahren" button
    And the user enters a valid username
    And the user enters a valid password
    And the user confirms the stay signed in prompt
    Then the user should see the Knowledge Navigator homepage

  @smoke-test
  Scenario: Login fails with invalid username
    Given the user opens the login page
    When the user clicks the "Mit Keycloak anmelden" button
    And the user clicks the "Fortfahren" button
    And the user enters an invalid username
    And the user enters a valid password
    Then the user should see an error message about invalid credentials

  @smoke-test
  Scenario: Login fails with invalid password
    Given the user opens the login page
    When the user clicks the "Mit Keycloak anmelden" button
    And the user clicks the "Fortfahren" button
    And the user enters a valid username
    And the user enters an invalid password
    Then the user should see an error message about invalid credentials

  @smoke-test
  Scenario: Successful logout
    Given the user is logged into the system
    When the user clicks on the profile dropdown
    And the user clicks on the "Ausloggen" option
    Then the user should be redirected to the login page

